rying-to-stop-their-25-5-acre-farm-from-becoming-another-subdivision-the-land-is-now-permanently-protected-from-development-even-as-homes-spread-around-it/articleshow/134281973.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T00:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134282204,imgsize-2574252.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Praadhyumn Indaana, 17, whose AI cut nuclear heat-limit error from 63% to 5.5%; he won $50K]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134265837.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Praadhyumn Indaana has created a groundbreaking physics-guided neural network tailored for nuclear reactors. This cutting-edge model has significantly lowered prediction errors associated with critical heat flux, providing enhanced insights into reactor operating parameters. His remarkable achievement not only secured him a substantial scholarship but also garnered him noteworthy recognition, showcasing the immense capabilities of AI in addressing intricate scientific engineering problems.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-praadhyumn-indaana-the-17-year-old-montvale-new-jersey-student-whose-ai-model-cut-nuclear-reactor-heat-limit-prediction-error-from-about-63-to-5-5-he-won-50000/articleshow/134265837.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-praadhyumn-indaana-the-17-year-old-montvale-new-jersey-student-whose-ai-model-cut-nuclear-reactor-heat-limit-prediction-error-from-about-63-to-5-5-he-won-50000/articleshow/134265837.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-16T23:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134266262,imgsize-1300608.cms"/></item><i